@Fpfl.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5132

### All item types
GET {{Fpfl.Api_HostAddress}}/item-types
Accept: application/json

### One item type
GET {{Fpfl.Api_HostAddress}}/item-types/1
Accept: application/json

### Not found -> 404 ApiResponse with correlationId
GET {{Fpfl.Api_HostAddress}}/item-types/999
Accept: application/json

### Validation -> 400 ApiResponse
GET {{Fpfl.Api_HostAddress}}/item-types/0
Accept: application/json

### Health
GET {{Fpfl.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Auth: run "Guest login" first, then copy accessToken / refreshToken below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token-here

### Guest login (no password sent)
POST {{Fpfl.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/guest
Accept: application/json

### Login
POST {{Fpfl.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "guest.user@gmail.com",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### Who am I (needs accessToken)
GET {{Fpfl.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Who am I without a token -> 401 ApiResponse
GET {{Fpfl.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/me

### Refresh (each refresh token works once)
POST {{Fpfl.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Logout (revokes the refresh token)
POST {{Fpfl.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Change password as guest -> 403 ApiResponse
POST {{Fpfl.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "anything",
  "newPassword": "something-new"
}
